eval_data[0]: {'User': ["Write a free verse poem about the power of the human spirit to overcome adversity, using vivid imagery and sensory language to depict a specific moment or event where someone has faced a major challenge and risen above it. Consider the emotions, thoughts, and actions that led to this triumph and use these to craft a powerful and inspiring message about resilience and inner strength. Be sure to employ literary devices such as metaphor, repetition, and symbolism to enhance the poem's impact and meaning.", "Could you add some more imagery to describe the woman's surroundings or the specific obstacles she faced?", "Wow, your poem is truly moving. Can you add some more sensory details to describe the woman's emotions and actions as she overcomes her obstacles?", 'Can you add a few lines about what inspired the woman to keep going despite the obstacles in her path?'], 'Model': ['In the face of adversity,\nWhen the road ahead seems steep\nAnd the path is lined with obstacles,\nThe human spirit rises up.\n\nIt is a force that cannot be tamed,\nA will that cannot be broken,\nA flame that burns bright even in the darkest of times.\n\nI have seen this spirit in action,\nIn the eyes of a woman who lost everything\nBut never lost her hope.\n\nShe stood, tall and strong,\nHer back straight, her eyes fierce,\nDefying the world that tried to break her.\n\nAnd in that moment, I saw the power of the human spirit,\nA force that can conquer even the greatest of trials.\n\nFor this woman, it was not just about surviving,\nBut about thriving, about rising above her circumstances.\n\nWith each step she took, she showed us all\nThat there is nothing that can hold us back,\nNothing that can stop us from rising.\n\nAnd so I stand here, in awe of this spirit.\nThe power of resilience that lies within us all,\nWaiting to be unleashed, waiting to be set free.', 'In the face of adversity,\nWhen the road ahead seems steep\nAnd the path is lined with obstacles,\nThe human 